#ASSERT `Must my licence be provisional` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 14 3 2020) 0
#ASSERT `Must my licence be provisional` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 13 3 2022) (`completed months between` (Date 14 3 2020) (Date 13 3 2022))
#ASSERT NOT `Must my licence be provisional` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 14 3 2022) (`completed months between` (Date 14 3 2020) (Date 14 3 2022))

#ASSERT `What P plates must I display` TRUE (`completed months between` (Date 30 8 2023) (Date 30 8 2023)) EQUALS `red P plates (a white P on red)`
#ASSERT `What P plates must I display` TRUE (`completed months between` (Date 30 8 2023) (Date 1 3 2024)) EQUALS `green P plates (a white P on green)`

