§ `s 16-18, r 53B-53C, s 24 -- what disqualification does to my licence`

#ASSERT `What happens to my licence when I am disqualified` TRUE `disqualified under Part 4 (demerit points)` FALSE EQUALS `cancelled`
#ASSERT `What happens to my licence when I am disqualified` TRUE `disqualified by a fines enforcement licence suspension order or a Road Traffic Act s 71C notice` FALSE EQUALS `suspended while the disqualification lasts`
#ASSERT `What happens to my licence when I am disqualified` FALSE `disqualified by a court on conviction` TRUE EQUALS `cancelled`

